Redesign v2 — fixpack for the LOCAL tree (ahead of origin/main).
Apply from the repo root against your LOCAL working copy:

    git apply handoff/0005-redesign-v2-fixpack.patch
    # whitespace drift fallback (reads were space-mangled in transit):
    patch -p1 -l < handoff/0005-redesign-v2-fixpack.patch
    # last resort:  git apply --reject ...  then inspect *.rej

Then:  uv run pytest -n auto

Contents
  widgets.py
    W1  add time/timedelta imports
    W2  WorksheetHeader: empty counters no longer hide the active IP (break -> continue)
    W3  MachineStatusStrip: T+ exam clock — persisted start via store settings
        ("exam_started_at"), session fallback, 1s tick; offline + passive
    W4  update_status(): accept checklist_total/checklist_done — app.py's
        _update_checklist_progress already passes them; without this the call
        raises TypeError and except:pass swallows it (progress silently stale).
        Recompute happens BEFORE self.refresh() so the bar repaints immediately.
    W5  render T+ next to the scope badge
    W6  :theme hint listed retired palettes (moss/neon/mono/warm) -> cyber/sugary/candy/caramel
  app.py
    A1  import time
    A2  import current_palette (needed by A3)
    A3  scope toggle: hardcoded #8FA876/#E5846B -> palette tokens (P.ok / P.danger)
    A4  first target added starts the persistent exam clock (store.set_setting)
  theme.py
    T1  module docstring listed retired palettes -> current seven
    T2  APP_CSS: #status-strip never matched (widget mounts as #target-info)
    T3  same fix in the compact/compact-height rules (strip now shrinks to 2 rows)

Not included (need those files): commands.py audit (help/quit dispatch,
autocomplete parity), modals.py (theme-picker 1-8 hint label).

